			text = [=[The Greymane Wall runs across the southern edge of {link:silverpine-forest}Silverpine{/link} and seals the kingdom of {link:gilneas}Gilneas{/link} from the north. {link:genn-greymane}King Genn Greymane{/link} raised it after the {link:second-war}Second War{/link}, and its gates have stayed shut ever since, even when the plague came. Before the wall, humans who fled the north have made a camp of the desperate. Many are sick. A blind smith works among them. Worgen and worgs prowl close by, and the {link:forsaken}Forsaken{/link} fear that the curse is passing to the refugees. The Gilneans have made it plain that no one will be let through.]=],
